          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Offerings — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Workshops, series, and integrative visits focusing on whole-person care.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#F6FFF5;--bg2:#E8F7FF;--accent:#3A7CA5;--muted:#61707A;--card:#ffffff}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;color:#0b2430;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));}\\n    a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 40px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6AC8C6,#3A7CA5);color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    nav a[aria-current=\\\"page\\\"]{color:#092A33;font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n\\n    /* split_diagonal hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;margin:20px 0}\\n    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(10,20,25,0.06);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}\\n    .kicker{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.6px}\\n    h1{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px}\\n    .hero-visual{position:relative;height:320px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .diag-split{position:absolute;left:-30%;top:-20%;width:160%;height:140%;transform:rotate(-12deg);background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(58,124,165,0.14),rgba(106,200,198,0.12));filter:blur(18px)}\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0}\\n\\n    /* services list */\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .service{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);min-height:120px}\\n    .service h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px}\\n    .service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* micro habits */\\n    .micro{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}\\n    .micro .chip{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#F0FFFC,#FFF9F0);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:#0b2430}\\n\\n    /* pricing & cta */\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .price{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdff)}\\n    .cta{align-self:center}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    footer{margin:40px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\\n    }\\n    @media (max-width:560px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Nest</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How we work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero card\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Offerings & Events</div>\\n        <h1>Series, workshops, and guided visits for whole-person care</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Small cohorts, seasonal workshops, and individual consults that place biology in conversation with lifestyle and meaning. Each series weaves learning, gentle accountability, and practical habits.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"micro\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">6-week Gut Resilience</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Sleep Rhythm Workshop</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Stress & Breath Cohort</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Monthly Open Q&amp;A</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"price card\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"font-size:18px\\\">Cohorts from $249</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px\\\">Sliding-scale seats available. Educational material included.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-visual\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"diag-split\\\"></div>\\n        <!-- inline SVG pattern unique to this page -->\\n        <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 360\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6AC8C6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/>\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#3A7CA5\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.5\\\"/>\\n            </linearGradient>\\n            <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n              <rect width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n              <circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.45)\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M0 40 L80 40\\\" stroke=\\\"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n            </pattern>\\n            <filter id=\\\"soft\\\" x=\\\"-50%\\\" y=\\\"-50%\\\" width=\\\"200%\\\" height=\\\"200%\\\">\\n              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"8\\\"/>\\n            </filter>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\"/>\\n          <g filter=\\\"url(#soft)\\\">\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"180\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"#FFF6EA\\\" opacity=\\\"0.35\\\"/>\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"140\\\" cy=\\\"90\\\" rx=\\\"160\\\" ry=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"#E8F7FF\\\" opacity=\\\"0.28\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n          <text x=\\\"30\\\" y=\\\"320\\\" font-size=\\\"28\\\" fill=\\\"#0b2430\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</text>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:20px\\\">What we offer</h2>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px\\\">Selectable paths — join a series or arrange a short course of visits.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Led by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Group Series</h3>\\n          <p>6–8 week cohorts that combine teaching, shared reflection, and practical habit-building. Ideal for restorative learning with peer support.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Workshops</h3>\\n          <p>Single-session deep dives on sleep, digestion, stress resilience, and seasonal self-care. Materials provided for home practice.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Individual Integrative Visits</h3>\\n          <p>Focused assessment and personalized guidance; a space to untangle symptoms, patterns, and lifestyle possibilities.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Open Learning Evenings</h3>\\n          <p>Drop-in talks; bring questions. These are educational and community-oriented, not diagnostic clinics.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Follow-up Packages</h3>\\n          <p>Short sequences of check-ins to adapt plans and sustain new rhythms—designed as learning cycles, not guarantees.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Resource Library</h3>\\n          <p>Handouts, recipes, and micro-habit sequences to carry practice beyond sessions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Daily little things — micro practices you can start now</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">Small, repeatable actions scaffold larger change. We teach short routines you can adapt to your life.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">3-minute breathing reset</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Night wind-down ritual</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Gentle gut-friendly breakfast</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"chip\\\">A daily movement prompt</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Pricing & access</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Workshops from $35; cohorts from $249; individual visits billed per session. Scholarships and sliding scale on request.</p>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px\\\">Education-first: sessions focus on learning and support. Not a promise of cure.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"width:260px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Ready to join?</h4>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Concerns & Common Patterns — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Common health concerns we support with education and whole-person plans.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#FFFDF9;--ink:#092A33;--soft:#7E8A8F;--accent:#9D5CFF}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#F4FBFF)}\\n    header{padding:22px 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{font-weight:800;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#FAF7FF);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(22,18,52,0.04)}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--soft);font-size:13px}\\n    nav a[aria-current=\\\"page\\\"]{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\\n    .container{max-width:1000px;margin:18px auto;padding:18px}\\n\\n    .hero{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero .text{flex:1;padding:18px}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--soft);margin-top:8px}\\n\\n    /* content tiles */\\n    .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .tile{background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 26px rgba(8,18,20,0.04)}\\n    .tile h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .tile p{margin:0;color:var(--soft);font-size:14px}\\n    .disclaimer{margin-top:14px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    /* subtle SVG corner */\\n    .corner{width:160px;height:160px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:760px){.tiles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Method</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text card\\\">\\n        <h1>Common concerns we help people explore</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">We pair evidence-informed education with lifestyle-centered planning. These are areas where people frequently seek guidance.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"corner\\\">\\n        <!-- small decorative svg pattern -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"c1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#9D5CFF\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.16\\\"/>\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FFB86C\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"url(#c1)\\\"/>\\n          <g fill-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\">\\n            <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"110\\\" r=\\\"36\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"tiles\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Stress & Resilience</h3>\\n        <p>Patterns of tension, overwhelm, and burnout. We explore nervous-system practices, pacing, and daily rituals to shift reactivity.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Sleep Difficulty</h3>\\n        <p>Trouble falling or staying asleep often reflects routines, light exposure, and stress. Educational tools and sleep-friendly habits are central.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Digestive Disturbance</h3>\\n        <p>Bloating, irregularity, and discomfort are approached through diet patterns, timing, mindful eating, and gentle lifestyle change.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Pain & Inflammation</h3>\\n        <p>Chronic discomfort invites a combined look at movement, anti-inflammatory patterns, sleep, and stress modulation as parts of a plan.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Low Energy & Fatigue</h3>\\n        <p>Energy is shaped by sleep, nutrition, activity, and meaning. We prioritize measurement, pacing, and reproducible micro-habits.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"tile\\\">\\n        <h3>Emotional Upset</h3>\\n        <p>Anxiety, low mood, or shifts in appetite and motivation are treated by education, breathing, consistent routines, and recommended supports.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"disclaimer card\\\">\\n      <strong>Note:</strong> These descriptions are educational. Individual responses vary. Our work emphasizes symptom understanding, risk-reduction, and sustainable habits, not guaranteed cures. Serious or acute conditions may require urgent medical care.\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Explore programs &amp; book</a>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:28px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Our Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"How intake, planning, and follow-up come together in a whole-person, educational approach.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#FCFEFF;--ink:#07323E;--muted:#62767A;--accent:#2DAF9B}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#FCFEFF,#F7FBFF);color:var(--ink)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 26px}\\n    .logo{font-weight:800}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    nav a[aria-current=\\\"page\\\"]{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:18px}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:20px;align-items:center}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(12,20,24,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0}\\n\\n    .stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .stage{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#F6FFFD)}\\n    .stage h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .stage p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    .labs{margin-top:16px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}\\n    .micro{margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}\\n    .chip{background:#EFFFFB;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:#07524B;font-size:13px}\\n\\n    .note{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .book{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n    @media (max-width:700px){.stages{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Begin</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Method</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h1>How we work — a patient learning arc</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Our approach marries careful listening with teachable interventions. We design plans you can practice, measure, and refine.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <!-- diagonal motif as svg -->\\n        <svg width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"ag\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#2DAF9B\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6AC8C6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/>\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"14\\\" fill=\\\"url(#ag)\\\"/>\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 120 L160 20 L160 160 L0 160 Z\\\" fill=\\\"#FFFFFF\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n          <text x=\\\"14\\\" y=\\\"86\\\" font-size=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"#03353A\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\">Listen → Plan</text>\\n        </svg>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\\\">Intake, clarity, ongoing care</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"stages\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n        <h3>1. Intake (Listen)</h3>\\n        <p>We begin with a focused conversation: story, priorities, and a guided review of patterns. This is where symptoms become context.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n        <h3>2. Assessment (Understand)</h3>\\n        <p>We synthesize history and relevant data. When helpful, we discuss optional labs to inform educational conversations—not as mandatory orders.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n        <h3>3. Plan (Practice)</h3>\\n        <p>Rather than single fixes, plans are modular: small habits, pacing, nutrition patterns, and measurable steps you can trial and adjust.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n        <h3>4. Follow-up (Refine)</h3>\\n        <p>Short check-ins help translate learning into durable habits. We tune, troubleshoot, and add layers of support.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"labs card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"labs-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"labs-title\\\">Optional educational labs</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We may suggest common, non-invasive tests (labs, nutrient markers, sleep tracking) only when they will inform education and choice. Labs are optional and explained before any order.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">Micro practices we teach</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"micro\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Night breathing cue</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Gentle morning movement</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Mindful evening meal</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"chip\\\">5-minute reset</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"note\\\">These are simple, repeatable acts meant to translate knowledge into daily life.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"book\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Begin an intake with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px\\\">Sessions are educational; not a promise of cure. For urgent issues, please seek emergency care.</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
